WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.500
Finally, the seller's view. AI agents are now walking into your store.

2
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:13.500
Some shop for real people. Some scrape your prices. From the outside, they can look the same.

3
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:24.000
Silvector starts in monitor mode. It watches every agent, explains its assessment, and shows what it would do, without blocking anything.

4
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:33.000
When you're ready, switch to enforce. Only the rules you approve take effect.

5
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Good agents get through, within their limits, and they buy. A large order steps up to the person behind it first.

6
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:51.500
This one carries a copied delegation and scrapes every price. Silvector blocks it, and revokes its access.

7
00:00:51.500 --> 00:01:00.500
Every decision leaves a signed, plain-English receipt, readable by you, the agent, and the person who sent it.

8
00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:05.500
See every agent. Decide every visit. Keep every receipt.

9
00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:10.500
Silvector. Seen, decided, signed.

